  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Leo is at school. He has silly socks. They are red and green. \"Nice socks, Leo!\" says Mia. Teacher Kim comes in. \"Good morning, class!\" \"Sit, please.\" Leo sits at his desk.",
      "\"Today we draw,\" says Teacher Kim. Leo has a pen and a book. He makes a drawing. It is his dad. Dad can drive a truck. Leo goes to the board. He draws the truck there. \"Don't draw on the board!\" \"It is for words.\" \"Sorry!\" says Leo.",
      "Leo has candy. He eats a candy. \"Don't eat in class!\" says Teacher Kim. \"Eat at lunch.\" He puts it in his bag. \"Can I ask a question?\" asks Mia. \"Yes,\" says Teacher Kim. \"Can I have candy at lunch?\" Leo smiles. \"Yes!\" he says."
    ],
    "summary": "Leo has silly socks and a candy at school. Teacher Kim tells him what not to do in class.",
